-- 2. Algebraic degree per round -----------------------------
   an order-k derivative vanishes iff the degree is BELOW k, so the
   informative quantity is the LARGEST k with a non-zero sum: it
   gives degree >= k. We scan k downwards and stop at the first hit.
    rounds    degree lower bound  note
         1                     1  order 2 and above all vanish
