-- Interpretation --------------------------------------------
   An integral distinguisher at round d means: with 2^k chosen
   plaintexts an attacker distinguishes d-round Dedalyan from a
   random permutation. Key recovery typically adds 2-3 rounds on
   top of the distinguisher, so compare d + 3 against 16.

